{"generated": "2026-07-30 12:46", "brief": "<b>1. IPO 시장 제도 개편 및 동향</b>\n금융당국이 공모주 상장 직후 폭락을 막기 위해 코너스톤 투자자 제도 및 사전수요예측 제도 도입을 위한 자본시장법 하위법규 개정을 예고하며 11월 시행을 추진하고 있다. 이는 IPO 공모가 산정의 투명성을 높이고 기관 투자자에게 최대 30%의 물량을 사전 배정하여 시장 안정성을 확보하려는 조치로, IPO 시장에 큰 변화를 가져올 것으로 예상된다. [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE56RXhlenFDRWlublVhRGdxUXZsTmt5UHNsbnhocGppSkdZUER6bldwSVFLeXNmZmprQ3A3OUljbHdZYnp6TnR3cVZnX2FDOFlEN1JuekJOSE10cDdzV2dZTVRCYmp1bG82d2YwbXhULVE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFBIYjNMbkxMTnRsVUgtandpTjRoaWpNdHJTLVNTMkZyQm5DT291V0xSRURtdGlxT3hFcmtmYmczaEJiMDYtWWpNR0t3WjdQT0RzaDgyVVFvY2VOQl83aV9tMHFhTHJhemVD?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE0tX2pFS1dpM1UzekhaWWdZYVZ3dVU2ZGZJdWJ0dVBXanNzNENWUXpTdGg3MFgwcC1qUXk5TG9RRkhVOXZBZjFMVy1JOXgzd1ZsOG5nbGlBdHZpMWJQbVVlNzFKaXMzeVV1N3FEVnRMbnpNUUk?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a> <a href=\"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20260730084900002\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#28</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE5WLTVPRFFrNnJXbWhtem00UGJSRVVaOUhBUkoxSUl0aXNQeU5Rdm1LSk5HY3lfREdQYmhrNE5QNEdqa2RWTl9qamRBamRsTGZuVFVqenJZYzJoaEhkalZF?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1kQkt5VGFydWpXQUFhXy1paXJ3b2xQd2VfdTJ4c0xZekc4S01NQlowYmtCbWdnbHRWMXBwWHpCVnh1ZnFPUWNSbUdEUDdHaVZZdC14d282WDV4QQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTFBLbXlfdTg0emRnTWtpNEVidlVqQXlvaldOamRXLWdxZXFKdGxreUt4eDg3Z0w2LXcxMkxmellXVjcza3hzU0xCNGZ2TnhmM2VPTXV5VA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5ZUmdPeWd0R0lCM0xRczRBOGpKZ0JlVW45VWY5MWRqd25wOFN3a2trcUJjaDdLT1p